' The tuning knobs' defaults, names and ranges. Written by tools/tuning/make_knobs.py from tools/tuning/knobs.txt. Do not edit.
' load_tuning and the SUBs these call are in io/tuning_file.bm.

' Sets every knob to its default: the number the game had before it was a knob.
SUB tuning_defaults
